  "description": "After dying three times, Hillia finally learns the truth: she’s stuck in a novel where a cunning woman keeps killing her to take her place. On her last chance, she strikes a deal with the feared crown prince—fated to lose himself to madness. He kidnaps her at her wedding, and in return, she helps him ease his affliction and claim the throne. Now she must navigate both her enemy’s schemes and the prince’s volatile temper. Can she outplay the woman who ended her while surviving the man she chose?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
